{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_glassb_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_glassb_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "再见以前",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_glassb_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dc16af2f05f46e9f84be70fd50d356f8b1ab6c445ad142e18cb54360032ec1d8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......要穿哪一件呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件穿着有点紧，这件袖子有点短，古米第一次觉得，选衣服是个好困难的事情啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前都是看见什么，就穿什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不，试试这件吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......古米记得，这件是早露姐给古米买的......爸爸妈妈一定会觉得好看吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼呼......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉......拉达，你是不是穿反了？兜帽都跑到前面来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，我帮你换过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢真理姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好不容易要和爸爸妈妈见面了，结果还是笨笨的，一点变化也没有，这怎么行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白啦，没关系的！只要古米能见到他们就好啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米已经把和姐姐们的故事记在本本里了，到时候都要讲给他们听！还拍了好多在罗德岛的生活照片，相册有这么厚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后......这个！是我给爸爸妈妈准备的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......饼干模具？这都是什么形状......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，这些都是代表姐姐们的！在看书的是真理姐，戴耳机的是凛冬姐，帽子歪歪的是早露姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，那这个长角的......该不会是罗莎琳吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是噢，那个是角峰大叔......古米学做模具的时候，角峰大叔教了很久，所以古米也把他放进来啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烈夏姐是这个抱着蜂蜜罐的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做得都挺精致的，拉达很用心啊......欸，没有代表拉达的图案吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？爸爸妈妈能见到古米......还需要代表古米的模具吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有实实在在的古米陪着他们就好啦，爸爸妈妈不会介意的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了......真理姐要给自己的爸爸妈妈送什么礼物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......还没有准备礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主要是，突然知道他们还活着，而且真的能和他们再见面......总觉得，有点不真实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不真实......古米不明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米知道找到爸爸妈妈了，可是高兴得好几晚都睡不着觉呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也很高兴，也很激动，恨不得马上跑到他们身边去。只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好不容易从切尔诺伯格逃出来，和你们经历了那么多事情......然后又来到罗德岛，一起生活了这么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前也不是没有过他们的消息，但每次到最后都没了下文。万一这回......我的意思是万一，这回也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，既然已经找到他们了......就不想那么多了，我们好好做准备吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达！你开门啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎哎，别这么大声啊，等......你干什么，该不会是想要把门砸开吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来试试吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，开门吧，好不好？大家都很担心你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你都快两天没吃东西了......要是把身体熬坏了，真等到爸爸妈妈来看你，你却没办法打起精神来和他们见面，那可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宿舍的门仍然紧闭，没有任何声音，没有任何回应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得了吧，娜塔莉娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人事部的那些家伙都说过了，也已经确认过了，这回关于拉达父母的消息又是错的。浪费感情的事，这已经不是第一回了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都知道，在那时的切尔诺伯格，自己能活下来已经是走大运了，至于找到亲人......还是早点认清现实比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要再给拉达这种虚假的期待了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达的父母不是一直在别的城市搞研究嘛，只是暂时没有确切的消息罢啦，总会找到的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，安娜的爸爸妈妈，不是也有消息了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过看拉达现在的情况，我父母的消息估计也不是准确的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么，如果真的搞错了，我也不会觉得怎么样......大概吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬&烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，都不用这样看着我。我明白你们怕我也像拉达一样，接受不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这么长时间都撑过来了，就算永远无法和父母见面，我们现在的生活又不会天翻地覆，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......拉达，没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你就想待在房间里，那就好好休息，好好睡一觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你心里不舒服，就来找我吧。我们可以再多拍一些照片......要是相册装不下了，我们还可以买新的相册。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者我们一起画点什么？画我们之前一起在书上看到的姜饼怪人，或者画我们之前设想过的，可以住下我们五个人的大房子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有拳击台，可以让索尼娅和罗莎琳打个痛快。还有个放着超大烤箱的厨房，娜塔莉娅和我可以陪你一起做新裱花样式的小蛋糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有你说过要给我准备的，可以放下好多好多书的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......可算找到了，原来你们都在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真理小姐，这有一封你的信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，刚刚送到。信使还特别嘱咐我们，一定要尽快交到真理小姐手里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（信封看上去还很新，封口处还能辨别出胶水溢出的痕迹。落款的乌萨斯文字，有点亲切......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这种流畅隽秀的乌萨斯手写字体，好像在父亲书桌上的办公文稿中出现过，也好像在母亲枕边书的批注里出现过。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（奇怪，心跳怎么忽然有点加速......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不会吧？该不会真的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这封信......是我父母寄来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真理小姐，经过我们的审核确认，千真万确，绝对不会有错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛在莱塔尼亚的办事处已经和你的父母建立了联络......这封信，就是他们寄来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下面是，第六十五次“真实情境暴露式创伤记录自我诊疗”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这真的不是在做梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的父母，他们还活着，他们都在莱塔尼亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们在信里说，只要我做好准备，随时都可以回到他们身边生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于他们的生死......其实，之前我从来没有深入想过这个问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每当出现这种念头，我都会赶紧转移自己的注意力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很清楚，他们在政府大楼工作，而切尔诺伯格的市中心，被破坏得最为严重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直以来，他们的结局，对我而言是显而易见的。花费精力去探个究竟，并没有什么意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在假定无法和父母重逢的前提下，我留在了罗德岛，和索尼娅她们一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们把罗德岛当作一个新的开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还制作了一个详尽的长期日程表，为了让我们更快地习惯新生活，也为了让我们能够早点从那场噩梦中解脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们在这里学习，工作，参与一些力所能及的任务，干得还算不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们终于可以，对我们的未来有一些遐想了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......我却突然收到了父母的消息。突然告诉我，我可以把现在的一切都放下，回到父母身边去，就像过去一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我应该怎么做？我应该离开这里吗？离开罗德岛，离开自治团的伙伴们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是拉达，或者是索尼娅先找到了家人......她们又会怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达一直很想念爸爸妈妈，索尼娅虽然看上去不在乎，其实也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了......信，我可以先给父母写封信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉他们，我暂时不准备过去......我想留在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请进——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安娜，去不去吃饭？罗莎琳说要请客——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在写信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给你爸妈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅，你说我这样写合不合适，我给你念......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安娜，我真是搞不明白，你有什么话，等见到他们直接说不就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是我，我就写——“知道了，等着我回来”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不就完事儿了！多简单！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我暂时不准备去莱塔尼亚了。所以才要好好想这个话该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你开什么玩笑！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这两天我还要帮忙整理会客室的来访资料，还要写之前答应海蒂小姐的几篇读后感......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且罗德岛的课程也挺紧张的，虽然没有考试，但是那些知识点不好好弄明白可不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，之前不是说，下个星期我们五个要一起跟着杜宾教官去做任务演练吗？在后半年的干员培养计划里，自治团还有很多安排，我想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是因为拉达吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是因为拉达的话，我觉得大可不必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达她......一直想见她的父母，可是却一直没有找到，反倒是我先......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先找到了又怎样，你就不想见父母吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我当然也想见。可是，来到罗德岛以后，我自认为已经无法回到以前的生活了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们现在该怎么办，我们未来又该去向何方，这些才是我一直在考虑的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而像过去那样，再做一个被父母寄以厚望的高中生，我从未想过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如说，这可能吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道他们活着，还过得很好，对我来说就可以了，已经足够我高兴很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以先和他们保持信件往来，通过照片看看彼此现在的样子......等到假期，再和他们见面吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老实说，我很少见到这样慌乱，满脸写着忧虑的你，就连在彼得海姆中学的时候，也没有过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看着你现在的样子，谁能猜到你刚刚接到了一个天大的好消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论你最后怎么选择——父母，课程，工作，还有我们的未来......这些都很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你要想清楚的是，对于现在的你来说，什么才是最重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于我们几个，不需要你那么操心。在罗德岛上，我们都过得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看拉达，前几天还一直把自己关在屋里，今天就去厨房和芙蓉一起鼓捣新的蔬菜烘焙料理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才路过食堂的时候，她们笑得可大声了！还好我跑得快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你笑什么？你也想尝尝她们做的青椒角瓜流心饼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是啦，只是觉得，索尼娅今天好像和往常不太一样呢。该怎么说......感觉话很多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是以前，你估计会直接把我写的这封信撕烂，让我赶紧走......可能最多再撂下一句，“想那么多干嘛，麻烦死了”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在也变得会安慰人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......你干嘛，怎么自己把信纸撕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听从你的提议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先好好想想，现在对我而言，什么才是最重要的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂喂，你不要耍赖啊！不是说好了最后一杯嘛？而且刚才明明是我赢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈嗝......索尼娅，你就喝吧，刚才那杯，是刚才的你喝的，不算！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，现在的你，还没喝过......所以现在的你，要喝现在这杯！呃......嗝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗莎琳！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我受不了了，实在是没完没了啊，下次说什么也不能答应她买这么多蜂蜜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜塔莉娅，你陪她喝吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？......可是，我不是很喜欢喝蜂蜜啊......就算是泡红茶的时候，我也从来不放蜂蜜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你这家伙，该不会从来没有大口大口地喝过蜂蜜吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等、等一下啊唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（说是要给我开送别会，怎么感觉完全是她们找了个借口来胡闹啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不过......这样其实也挺好？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真理姐......这些，送给你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......欸？送给我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些模具，不是你要送给爸爸妈妈的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......古米这回不是见不到他们了吗......送给真理姐，也一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......等下次再有他们的消息，你不就没得送了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，等到那时候，古米再做新的也来得及呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿着平底锅的......这个是拉达吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！是古米新做的噢！这样代表我们五个人的模具就都齐啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等真理姐回家的时候，就可以把凛冬姐她们和古米一起带回去啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拉达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你，等我回来，也会给你带小礼物的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......安娜，你还要回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陪爸爸妈妈待一段时间，我就回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？既然找到家人了，就和他们开始新生活呗，还回来干什么......呜嗝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗莎琳，没有那么简单啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道只要回到他们的身边去，新生活就自然而然地开始了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......该不会你们都认为，我离开罗德岛，是更好的选择吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露&古米",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不一定是更好的选择，但至少是多了一种选择呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛很好，给了我们一个安身之所。不过，这是因为我们无处可去，所以这里才成为我们最好的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是安娜，对于现在的你来说，情况可不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，可能在我们每个人心里，早就做好了总有人会先离开的准备吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就算真的到了说再见的那天，我也会是守到最后的那个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许你还在顾虑着我们的感受，但事实上，你找到了家人，我们都挺高兴的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哦！既然真理姐能找到爸爸妈妈，那古米总有一天也能找到他们的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米也觉得，真理姐离开罗德岛会更好哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，该怎么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是......如果古米留在罗德岛，也可能会成为厉害的厨师，凛冬姐、烈夏姐和早露姐也能成为战场上的大将......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是对于真理姐来说，还是留在爸爸妈妈身边，回到学校读书更好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你到了莱塔尼亚，估计你爸妈早就帮你办好了入学手续，你只要背着书包去学校就行了，和以前在切尔诺伯格时一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那之后的事情就当作都没发生过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么可能当作都没发生啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅，难道在你看来，只要有机会，那么重新开始就是最好的选择吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对我来说不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么对我来说，也一样不会是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经做好决定了。我还是会过去，去看看爸爸妈妈过得好不好，去看看他们有没有变老很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能......我也会和他们讲，在那时的彼得海姆中学，我都感受过怎样的黑暗，又是怎样和一帮可靠的朋友们熬了过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，我也会给他们讲讲罗德岛。拉达和我拍了很多照片，足够让他们想象我们在这里的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有......我也想向他们问清楚，他们是如何从切尔诺伯格逃出来，又是如何跑到莱塔尼亚去的......过了这么长时间，他们有没有找过我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安娜，这会花去很多时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以在新的家，陪着爸爸妈妈一起，慢慢解决你的所有困惑。你大可不必那么着急回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，这些都可以慢慢解决。但这些都不是我这次回去，要做的最重要的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的事是——我要说服他们，让他们同意我回到罗德岛，同意我留在伙伴们身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......我们看了那位太太的身份证件，发现她居然姓莫罗佐娃，还是从切尔诺伯格过来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在莱塔尼亚，要想遇到个从切尔诺伯格来的人，可不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好巧不巧，他们就住在罗德岛办事处的周围，那天来找我们，也是因为莫罗佐娃太太有点牙疼，却误把办事处当成了牙科诊所......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......后来我们才知道，虽然彼得海姆中学的事情......其他人都觉得没什么希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你的爸爸妈妈，他们一直没有放弃找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，他们还好吗？......住的地方怎么样？有新的工作了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，还不赖。办事处的小医生手艺还不错，至少你妈妈的牙应该是暂时不疼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他的具体情况，等你到了以后，再慢慢体会吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，知道了。非常感谢您专程送我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，也不算是专程。我定期会在本舰和各地办事处之间往返，送点物资，交接一些任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我开车从本舰送走的人，你也不是第一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被您从其他地方送回本舰的人，有几个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛司机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是......罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如我所期望的，我再次回到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在前往莱塔尼亚的路途中，我设想了无数种与父母重逢的情境......设想该怎么向他们表达我的决定，展现我的成长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是当我与他们相见时，所有设想都失去了意义。我们拥抱，依靠，然后讲述着不在彼此身边的日子......一切都那么自然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抵达的当天，爸爸硬要下厨，让我再尝尝家乡味的菜汤。结果转了好几个市场也没有买到洋葱，只能拿沙葱代替......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙葱味的菜汤，我还是头一回喝，味道不是不能接受......就是有点辣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们很喜欢拉达送的礼物，我们用那些模具来烤曲奇，烤了好多好多，一连吃了好几天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说拉达做饭很好吃，爸爸他还很不服气，一定要找机会比试比试......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，通过我讲述的故事，还有我带去的照片，他们已经记住了自治团每个成员的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出乎我意料的，他们很痛快地同意了我留在罗德岛的决定。还塞给我一堆莱塔尼亚的特产小吃，让我给朋友们带回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些特产已经被自治团分光了。可以说......“清扫”得一干二净。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切都很顺利，甚至可以说有点太顺利了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，第六十六次“自我诊疗”结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，还是有一点在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然父母理解并支持我的选择，但也表达了他们的担忧与挂虑。他们还提出了一个我从未想过的疑问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“如果，未来自治团的成员们都离开了罗德岛，选择了不同的方向，去了不同的地方，你该怎么办？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......要去莱塔尼亚吗？还是继续留在罗德岛？或者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（叹气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少现在，父母都很支持我，伙伴们也还在身边，至于之后......从现在开始，好好思考自己未来的打算吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？我的通讯终端呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到了......怎么在床底下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得......可露希尔小姐的联系方式是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊......怎么突然响了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，啊......是可露希尔小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "录像机？噢，是我借走了......不用不用！我已经用完啦，一会儿就还回去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，可露希尔小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您之前提过的，去资料室帮忙的事......非常感谢您这么信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可以的话......我愿意试一试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
